[en.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_CITY_NEW]
New Sire’s Hollow

[en.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_CITY_NEW_desc]
On the northern shore of South Luna Ocean, a brand new city of the future has risen. The success of New Sire’s Hollow is a testament to the superiority of the Sire’s Hollow Joint Council model.

[zh.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_CITY_NEW]
新名流谷

[zh.FOCUS_C09_APPLEWOOD_CITY_NEW_desc]
在南露娜洋的北岸，一座崭新的未来城市已经拔地而起。新名流谷的成功是名流谷联合会模式不言自明的优越性证明。

